124
00:07:53,229 --> 00:07:58,091
docker stop waits for the grace period, then kills it:

125
00:07:58,091 --> 00:08:00,252
Exit code 137 = 128 + 9:

126
00:08:00,252 --> 00:08:04,304
the process was killed by signal 9 (SIGKILL).

127
00:08:06,067 --> 00:08:07,664
Let me try something.

128
00:08:07,664 --> 00:08:10,781
