136
00:08:34,780 --> 00:08:37,531
What do I need to remember?

137
00:08:38,067 --> 00:08:38,675
States:

138
00:08:38,675 --> 00:08:44,581
created → running ⇄ paused → exited → removed; run = create + start.

139
00:08:45,133 --> 00:08:51,333
stop sends SIGTERM, waits, then SIGKILL; kill sends SIGKILL at once.

140
00:08:51,867 --> 00:08:57,866
Exit code 137 means the process was killed, not that it finished.

141
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:02,534
What should I know about container names?

142
00:09:03,100 --> 00:09:11,930
Every container has a unique ID (64 hexadecimal characters, usually shown shortened to 12) and a unique name.

143
