Without --name, Docker invents one such as gallant_ritchie.

144
00:09:16,710 --> 00:09:24,244
Choosing names makes commands readable (docker logs api instead of docker logs 3f2a9c1e0b77),

145
00:09:24,244 --> 00:09:31,860
and on a user-defined network other containers can reach a container by its name (lesson 050).

146
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:37,729
